      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHENIMREADY (8) led to score here two back then worked to find the lead and kept kicking to make it two consecutive wins last time out at Gawler, getting home by close to 4 metres. Draws on the back row this time but is going well enough to overcome that and land the hat trick. ROLL WITH MUSTARD (7) dug deep and scored by a nose at this venue last start, the second win from his past four runs. Can settle just behind them and wait on the sprint lane. Big chance. OHSO KINKY (4) will be fitter for three solid efforts off a spell and goes well here with a win and a placing from two tries. Could be ready to peak. ELLA KATE (3) gets her best draw for some time and is suited up to a distance where she has recorded two wins and two placings from four attempts.",
